msgstr "— 向右平移"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Strogg enemies lead their shots. Keep moving laterally while firing to avoid damage."
msgstr "— 斯特罗格敌人会预判你的走位提前射击,开火时请保持横向移动以避免受伤。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The Super Nailgun is one of the most ammo-efficient weapons. Prioritize finding it."
msgstr "— 超级钉枪是弹药效率最高的武器之一,优先找到它。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The Uplink demo gives limited supplies. Use the crowbar on headcrabs and save bullets for soldiers."
msgstr "— Uplink 演示版补给有限。用撬棍对付头蟹,把子弹留给士兵。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The axe and sword deal heavy damage and don't consume ammo. Use them on weaker enemies."
msgstr "— 斧头和剑伤害很高,而且不消耗弹药,用来对付较弱的敌人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The bow is effective but arrows are limited. Save them for tougher foes."
msgstr "— 弓很好用,但箭矢有限,留着对付更强的敌人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom_shareware.html.heex:78
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The chainsaw is devastating against Demons — it stunlocks them completely."
msgstr "— 电锯对恶魔的杀伤力惊人——能把它们完全锁在硬直中。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2_shareware.html.heex:84
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The colored dynamic lighting often signals combat areas and ambushes."
msgstr "— 彩色动态光照往往预示着战斗区域和伏击。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The demo includes challenging encounters. Quick-save with F5 frequently."
msgstr "— 演示版包含有难度的遭遇战,请经常用 F5 快速存档。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The detailed pixel art hides secret areas. Look for visual irregularities."
msgstr "— 精细的像素画面中隐藏着秘密区域,留意视觉上的异常之处。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The game deals with heavy themes. It's one of the darkest point-and-click adventures ever made."
msgstr "— 游戏涉及沉重的主题,是有史以来最黑暗的点击式冒险游戏之一。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_lure.html.heex:78
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The game is shorter than later Revolution titles. Don't overthink the puzzles."
msgstr "— 这款游戏比后来的 Revolution 作品更短,不要把谜题想得太复杂。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_fotaq.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The game's world expands significantly after the plane crash. Explore everywhere."
msgstr "— 飞机坠毁后,游戏世界会大幅扩展,到处探索吧。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The hub-based levels reward exploration with armor, weapons, and secret areas."
msgstr "— 以枢纽为核心的关卡会用护甲、武器和秘密区域奖励探索。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The in-game diary contains essential backstory and puzzle hints."
msgstr "— 游戏内的日记包含重要的背景故事和谜题提示。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The legendary 1996 cereal box promotion. A kid-friendly total conversion where you zap Flemoids with the Zorcher. Freeware."
msgstr "— 传说中的 1996 年谷物盒促销活动。这是一款适合儿童的完全转换作品,你要用 Zorcher 击退 Flemoid。免费软件。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The official Valve demo (1999) with 3 unique levels set in Black Mesa's underground labs. Freely redistributable."
msgstr "— Valve 官方演示版(1999 年),包含 3 个设定在黑山地下实验室的独特关卡。可自由再分发。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The official demo (1997). Unit 1 of the singleplayer campaign — fight the Strogg invasion. Freely redistributable shareware."
msgstr "— 官方演示版(1997 年)。单人战役第 1 单元——抵抗 Strogg 入侵。可自由再分发的共享软件。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The original Episode 1 shareware (10 levels). The grandfather of FPS games, created by id Software. Freely redistributable."
msgstr "— 原版第 1 章共享软件(10 个关卡)。由 id Software 开发的 FPS 游戏鼻祖。可自由再分发。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The original Episode 1 shareware (1996). Full 3D FPS with Lovecraftian horrors. Freely redistributable."
msgstr "— 原版第 1 章共享软件(1996 年)。完整 3D FPS,充满克苏鲁式恐怖。可自由再分发。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The original Episode 1 shareware (9 levels on Phobos). Freely redistributable."
msgstr "— 原版第 1 章共享软件(火卫一上的 9 个关卡)。可自由再分发。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The shotgun is your workhorse weapon. Use the pistol for weak enemies to conserve shells."
msgstr "— 霰弹枪是你的主力武器。对付弱小的敌人用手枪,以节省弹药。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_soltys.html.heex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The streamlined point-and-click interface keeps things accessible."
msgstr "— 简洁的点击式界面让操作更容易上手。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The top-down perspective makes small items harder to spot. Click everywhere."
msgstr "— 俯视视角让小物件更难发现,到处点一点。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_hacx.html.heex:83
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— The v1.2 release runs standalone — no DOOM II required."
msgstr "— v1.2 版可独立运行——不需要 DOOM II。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_chex_quest.html.heex:46
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom_shareware.html.heex:52
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedm.html.heex:52
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom1.html.heex:52
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom2.html.heex:52
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_hacx.html.heex:52
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Toggle automap"
msgstr "— 切换自动地图"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_soltys.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Trying unusual interactions often yields funny responses and clues."
msgstr "— 尝试不寻常的互动往往会得到有趣的反应和线索。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein_3d.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Turn (or Alt + strafe)"
msgstr "— 转向(或 Alt + 平移)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake_shareware.html.heex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Underwater sections require careful air monitoring. Know your escape route."
msgstr "— 水下区域需要密切留意剩余空气,务必先想好撤退路线。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:84
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:44
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use / Open doors"
msgstr "— 使用 / 开门"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use / interact"
msgstr "— 使用 / 互动"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_chex_quest.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom_shareware.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedm.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom1.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom2.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_hacx.html.heex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use / open doors"
msgstr "— 使用 / 开门"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm.html.heex:129
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use F5 to save your progress. Some puzzles have time limits or points of no return."
msgstr "— 按 F5 保存进度。有些谜题有时间限制,或者存在无法回头的节点。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom_shareware.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use F6 for quicksave and F9 for quickload, especially before new areas."
msgstr "— 使用 F6 快速存档、F9 快速读档,尤其是在进入新区域之前。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2_shareware.html.heex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use crouch to access vents and low passages hiding secrets and shortcuts."
msgstr "— 蹲下可以进入通风管道和低矮通道,里面藏有秘密和捷径。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_rekkr.html.heex:77
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use runic magic abilities for crowd control when overwhelmed."
msgstr "— 被敌人围攻时,使用符文魔法来控制人群。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedm.html.heex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Use the IDCLEV## cheat code to warp to any map number."
msgstr "— 使用 IDCLEV## 作弊码可传送到任意地图编号。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm.html.heex:82
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Verb menu / examine"
msgstr "— 动词菜单 / 查看"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_hacx.html.heex:77
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Visually complex levels with lots of detail. Explore thoroughly for secrets."
msgstr "— 关卡视觉上很复杂,细节丰富。请彻底探索,寻找秘密。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_bass.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_drascula.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_fotaq.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_lure.html.heex:24
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_soltys.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Walk / interact with object"
msgstr "— 行走 / 与物体互动"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:113
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Walls with different textures often hide secret rooms with weapons and ammo. Press Use on everything."
msgstr "— 纹理不同的墙壁后面往往藏着放有武器和弹药的秘密房间。对每面墙都按一下“使用”键。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife_uplink.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Weapon category"
msgstr "— 武器类别"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:86
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:45
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:39
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Weapon select"
msgstr "— 选择武器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife_uplink.html.heex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Weapons have alt-fire modes. The shotgun's double-barrel blast is devastating up close."
msgstr "— 武器有备用射击模式。霰弹枪的双管齐射在近距离威力惊人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_hacx.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Weapons look and behave differently from classic DOOM. Learn their quirks."
msgstr "— 武器的外观和表现与经典 DOOM 不同。请熟悉它们的特点。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom2.html.heex:77
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Works with community DOOM II mods — decades of free content at your fingertips."
msgstr "— 支持社区制作的 DOOM II 模组——数十年的免费内容触手可及。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Yamagi Quake II compiled to WebAssembly via Emscripten. Features WebGL 2 rendering, software rendering fallback, and in-browser save games."
msgstr "— Yamagi Quake II 通过 Emscripten 编译为 WebAssembly。支持 WebGL 2 渲染、软件渲染回退,以及浏览器内存档。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein_3d.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— You can hear guards through doors. Plan your approach before opening."
msgstr "— 你可以隔着门听到守卫的声音。开门前先计划好行动方式。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— You can only carry a limited number of items. Choose wisely what to take."
msgstr "— 你能携带的物品数量有限。请明智地选择要带的东西。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2_shareware.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— You'll revisit areas with new keys and equipment. Remember the layout."
msgstr "— 你会带着新的钥匙和装备重返旧区域。请记住地图布局。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_lure.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Your companion Ratpouch can perform unique actions. Tell him to do things."
msgstr "— 你的同伴 Ratpouch 可以执行特殊动作。让他去做事吧。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Your starting Blaster has infinite ammo but low damage. Switch to better weapons as soon as you find them."
msgstr "— 你起始的 Blaster 弹药无限,但伤害较低。一找到更好的武器就换上。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— an open-source reimplementation of the GoldSource engine, compiled to WebAssembly via Emscripten (GPL-2.0). Features WebGL2 rendering and Web Audio support."
msgstr "— GoldSource 引擎的开源重新实现,通过 Emscripten 编译为 WebAssembly(GPL-2.0)。支持 WebGL2 渲染和 Web Audio。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— the legendary multi-engine adventure game interpreter with an official Emscripten backend, compiled to WebAssembly (GPL-3.0). Game data is loaded on-demand via HTTP filesystem."
msgstr "— 传奇的多引擎冒险游戏解释器,带有官方 Emscripten 后端,编译为 WebAssembly(GPL-3.0)。游戏数据通过 HTTP 文件系统按需加载。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:149
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:104
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:108
